                                "sense_id": "eae14c33-4763-3a0b-8eec-91df7945a15a",
                                "text": "The host of heauenly beautyes moue, / Depainted in their proper stories, / As well the fixd as wandring glories, / Which from their proper orbes not goe, / Whether they gyre swift or slowe: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dcd2bf14-4491-4750-bd1e-38fd74643c9a",
                                "sense_id": "eae14c33-4763-3a0b-8eec-91df7945a15a",
                                "text": "Jabberwocky. / 'Twas brillig, and the slithy toves / Did gyre and gimble in the wa[b]e; / All mimsy were the borogoves, / And the mome raths outgrabe."
                            }
                        ]
